 fixes:["Update over iTunes on a computer instead of over-the-air — the computer-side update needs much less free space on the device itself","Delete large apps, photos, or videos temporarily (back them up first) to clear staging space, then reinstall after updating","Offload rarely used apps and clear the Photos camera roll to iCloud/computer before attempting an OTA update"],
