 causes:["Find My iPhone / Activation Lock tied to the previous owner's Apple ID was never removed before the device was sold or reset"],
 fixes:["Contact the previous owner and ask them to remove the device from their Find My / iCloud account, or to enter their Apple ID password directly during setup","If purchased, request the original sales receipt and use Apple's Activation Lock status check plus support case to have Apple assist","Never buy/sell a used iPhone without confirming Activation Lock is off first — this is the single most common reason a used iPhone becomes unusable"],
