 fixes:["Run ScanDisk and fix any existing errors BEFORE attempting conversion, never during/after an interrupted one","Never interrupt the converter once started — ensure the PC is on stable power (UPS if possible)","If a conversion was interrupted, restore from backup rather than retrying on a half-converted volume","Keep a full backup before any filesystem conversion, which has no safe undo"],
