 fixes:["Disable desktop Active Content/Web wallpaper if enabled (Properties > Desktop)","Turn off unnecessary visual effects: Control Panel > Display > Effects","Ensure at least 64MB RAM is installed; ME is noticeably unstable below that","Apply the latest Windows ME Setup/Explorer updates via Windows Update if not already applied"],
