 fixes:["Press Ctrl+Shift+Esc to open Task Manager directly, then File > Run new task > explorer.exe to manually relaunch the shell","If that works once but doesn't persist, check Startup apps in Task Manager for a conflicting shell replacement utility","Create a new local user profile and migrate data if the original profile is corrupted beyond repair"],
